ifndef::skip_features_{{ lower(name) }},skip_{{ lower(name) }}_features,skip_{{ lower(name) }},skip_features[]
== Implemented Register Features & Architectural Overview

This register map specification defines the memory-mapped register interface for *{{ name }}*. The implemented registers incorporate the following architectural features:

{% if existsIn(features, "access_policies") and length(features.access_policies) > 0 %}
{% if length(features.access_policies) == 1 %}
* *Software Bus Access Policies*: Implements {{ features.access_policies_str }} access policy governing software bus read and write interactions.
{% else %}
* *Software Bus Access Policies*: Implements {{ features.access_policies_str }} access policies governing software bus read and write interactions.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if existsIn(features, "has_hw_precedence") and features.has_hw_precedence %}
* *Hardware Precedence & Sidebands*: Hardware write updates take strict precedence over software writes with dedicated hardware input (`hw_*_i`), write-enable (`hw_*_we_i`), and current state (`hw_*_o`) sideband ports.
{% else if existsIn(features, "has_hw_sidebands") and features.has_hw_sidebands %}
* *Hardware Sidebands*: Peripheral hardware monitors register state directly via dedicated current state (`hw_*_o`) sideband ports.
{% endif %}
* *Transaction Strobe Signals*: Active-high 1-cycle software read (`sw_*_rd_strobe_o`) and write (`sw_*_wr_strobe_o`) strobes for on-chip peripheral hardware triggering.
{% if existsIn(features, "has_byte_strobes") and features.has_byte_strobes %}
* *Bitfield Packing & Alignment*: Configurable bit slice ranges `[msb:lsb]` aligned to the {{ reg_width }}-bit data bus with byte-level write strobing (`wstrb`).
{% else %}
* *Bitfield Packing & Alignment*: Configurable bit slice ranges `[msb:lsb]` aligned to the {{ reg_width }}-bit data bus.
{% endif %}
{% if existsIn(features, "has_volatile") and features.has_volatile %}
* *Reset State & Volatility*: Explicit reset vectors and volatility qualifiers for fields altered asynchronously by peripheral hardware.
{% else %}
* *Deterministic Reset State*: Explicit power-on reset vectors for all bitfields.
{% endif %}
{% if existsIn(features, "has_memories") and features.has_memories %}
* *Direct Memory Windows*: Dedicated address windows mapped directly to internal or external SRAM buffers.
{% endif %}
{% if existsIn(features, "has_address_gaps") and features.has_address_gaps %}
* *Sparse Address Space*: Memory map accommodates non-contiguous register offsets with automatic address gap decoding.
{% endif %}
{% if existsIn(features, "has_interrupts") and features.has_interrupts %}
* *Interrupt & Event Management*: Dedicated sticky event flags and interrupt clear/acknowledge policies.
{% endif %}
{% if existsIn(features, "has_multiple_blocks") and features.has_multiple_blocks %}
* *Modular Multi-Block Hierarchy*: Organizes memory space into {{ length(blocks) }} independent register blocks.
{% endif %}

